WEBVTT

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:31.018
of the 2,000 malls that exist today,

00:09:31.042 --> 00:09:33.309
50 percent will be abandoned.

00:09:33.333 --> 00:09:38.101
Massive amount of material,
capturing resources,

00:09:38.125 --> 00:09:40.542
that will not be relevant soon.

00:09:41.292 --> 00:09:43.143
Or the Olympic stadiums.

00:09:43.167 --> 00:09:45.809
Around the globe, cities build these

00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:49.018
under great contestation
with massive resources,

00:09:49.042 --> 00:09:51.018
but after the games go,

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:53.476
they can't often
get absorbed into the city.

00:09:53.500 --> 00:09:56.934
Couldn't these be
nomadic structures, deflatable,

00:09:56.958 --> 00:09:58.768
we have the technology for that,

00:09:58.792 --> 00:10:03.143
that get gifted to smaller towns
around the world or in those countries,